{"version":1,"ok":true,"request_id":"audit-portfolio-template-list-20260906-v2","action":"post.list","dry_run":true,"completed_at_gmt":"2026-09-06T21:38:20+00:00","data":{"items":[{"id":4624,"type":"elementor_library","status":"publish","title":"Home - Remote Job Version","slug":"home-remote-job-version","content":"WordPress \u00b7 WooCommerce \u00b7 Elementor \u00b7 ACF \u00b7 Performance \u00b7 Remote NL\/EU\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Senior WordPress Web Developer<\/h1>\t\t<p>I build and improve WordPress, WooCommerce and Elementor websites that stay fast, manageable and ready to grow. Open to remote WordPress roles across the Netherlands and EU.<\/p>\t\t\t<h2>70+<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<h3>WordPress projects<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>10+<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Years\u2019 experience<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M313.941 216H12c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v56c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h301.941v46.059c0 21.382 25.851 32.09 40.971 16.971l86.059-86.059c9.373-9.373 9.373-24.569 0-33.941l-86.059-86.059c-15.119-15.119-40.971-4.411-40.971 16.971V216z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tView selected work\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/Yolol100\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M313.941 216H12c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v56c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h301.941v46.059c0 21.382 25.851 32.09 40.971 16.971l86.059-86.059c9.373-9.373 9.373-24.569 0-33.941l-86.059-86.059c-15.119-15.119-40.971-4.411-40.971 16.971V216z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tView GitHub\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPortfolio\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Selected WordPress work<\/h2>\t\t<p>Browse websites, WooCommerce webshops and custom WordPress plugins.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M528 0H48C21.5 0 0 21.5 0 48v320c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h192l-16 48h-72c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24s10.7 24 24 24h272c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24s-10.7-24-24-24h-72l-16-48h192c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V48c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48zm-16 352H64V64h448v288z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWordPress\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Websites<\/h3>\t\tResponsive WordPress websites with clear structure, strong usability and maintainable content, built with Elementor, ACF and custom front-end work.\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M528.12 301.319l47.273-208C578.806 78.301 567.391 64 551.99 64H159.208l-9.166-44.81C147.758 8.021 137.93 0 126.529 0H24C10.745 0 0 10.745 0 24v16c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h69.883l70.248 343.435C147.325 417.1 136 435.222 136 456c0 30.928 25.072 56 56 56s56-25.072 56-56c0-15.674-6.447-29.835-16.824-40h209.647C430.447 426.165 424 440.326 424 456c0 30.928 25.072 56 56 56s56-25.072 56-56c0-22.172-12.888-41.332-31.579-50.405l5.517-24.276c3.413-15.018-8.002-29.319-23.403-29.319H218.117l-6.545-32h293.145c11.206 0 20.92-7.754 23.403-18.681z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWooCommerce\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Webshops<\/h3>\t\tWooCommerce webshops focused on clear product discovery, responsive shopping flows and straightforward routes from browsing to checkout.\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M278.9 511.5l-61-17.7c-6.4-1.8-10-8.5-8.2-14.9L346.2 8.7c1.8-6.4 8.5-10 14.9-8.2l61 17.7c6.4 1.8 10 8.5 8.2 14.9L293.8 503.3c-1.9 6.4-8.5 10.1-14.9 8.2zm-114-112.2l43.5-46.4c4.6-4.9 4.3-12.7-.8-17.2L117 256l90.6-79.7c5.1-4.5 5.5-12.3.8-17.2l-43.5-46.4c-4.5-4.8-12.1-5.1-17-.5L3.8 247.2c-5.1 4.7-5.1 12.8 0 17.5l144.1 135.1c4.9 4.6 12.5 4.4 17-.5zm327.2.6l144.1-135.1c5.1-4.7 5.1-12.8 0-17.5L492.1 112.1c-4.8-4.5-12.4-4.3-17 .5L431.6 159c-4.6 4.9-4.3 12.7.8 17.2L523 256l-90.6 79.7c-5.1 4.5-5.5 12.3-.8 17.2l43.5 46.4c4.5 4.9 12.1 5.1 17 .6z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCustom WordPress\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Plugins<\/h3>\t\tCustom WordPress plugins and admin tools for specific workflows, integrations, performance improvements and automation.\t\t\t4+\t\t\t\t\tFocus Areas\t\t\t\t\tSpecialization\t\t\t\t\t<h2>WordPress development for fast, editable and maintainable websites<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<h3>WordPress &amp; WooCommerce Development<\/h3>\t\t<p>Structured websites and webshops with reusable sections, clean editing flows and less unnecessary plugin dependency.<\/p>\t\t\t<h3>Elementor &amp; ACF Builds<\/h3>\t\t<p>Editable page structures that clients can manage without breaking layout, content or design consistency.<\/p>\t\t\t<h3>Performance, WCAG &amp; Technical SEO<\/h3>\t\t<p>Core Web Vitals, accessible structure, lighter assets and technical SEO improvements that support speed, usability and search visibility.<\/p>\t\t\t<h3>GitHub, QA &amp; Automation<\/h3>\t\t<p>Git\/GitHub, GitHub Actions and Playwright for safer changes, repeatable checks and reliable delivery.<\/p>\t\t\tExperience\t\t\t\t\t<h2>10+ years of front-end, UX and WordPress experience<\/h2>\t\t<p>My background combines front-end development, UX thinking, SEO and WordPress. I use Git\/GitHub, automated checks and structured QA to keep work reliable and maintainable after launch.<\/p>\t\t\t2016 \u2014 2017\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Bergo<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\tFront-End Developer\t\t<p>Bergo was where I learned how a webshop works in practice. Working with developers and designers, I kept Magento pages clear, tidy and easy to use. That job gave me a solid start in building and improving websites.<\/p>\t\t\t2017 \u2014 2018\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Blueprint Sound Academy<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\tFront-End Developer\t\t<p>Blueprint Sound Academy gave me more room to work on the look and feel of a website. Small changes to layouts, navigation and page details made the site feel more consistent. From there, I started paying more attention to how people move through a website.<\/p>\t\t\t2018 \u2014 2019\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Kamernet<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\tUX Designer\t\t<p>At Kamernet, the user came first. Simple sketches and test screens helped us see where people got stuck before we built the final version. Their feedback showed me how a few small changes could make the whole journey easier.<\/p>\t\t\t2019 \u2014 2020\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Easytheorie<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\tWordPress Developer\t\t<p>Easytheorie was where WordPress became part of my everyday work. Clearer pages, better content and work on Google search helped people find the right information faster. WordPress, design and content started to come together for me there.<\/p>\t\t\t2020 \u2014 2021\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Wube<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\tWordPress Developer\t\t<p>Wube was where I started building complete WordPress websites for clients. Each project had different wishes, so I learned to turn them into a site that looked good and stayed easy to manage. Before launch, I checked phones, different browsers and speed so the site was ready to use.<\/p>\t\t\t2021 \u2014 Present\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Webactueel<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\tSenior WordPress Developer\t\t<p>Today at Webactueel, I work on WordPress and WooCommerce sites from start to finish. Some days I build pages, other days I fix a plugin, speed up a site or solve a client problem. Over time, I have made my own checks and tools so I can spot issues earlier and keep the work reliable.<\/p>\t\t\tMy workflow\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Remote-ready WordPress delivery: from idea to tested release<\/h2>\t\t<p>Every project starts with the goal, users and content. I then move through clear structure, WordPress development, Git\/GitHub, automated QA and performance\/accessibility checks so work can be reviewed and delivered reliably from anywhere.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 442.7L405.3 343c-4.5-4.5-10.6-7-17-7H372c27.6-35.3 44-79.7 44-128C416 93.1 322.9 0 208 0S0 93.1 0 208s93.1 208 208 208c48.3 0 92.7-16.4 128-44v16.3c0 6.4 2.5 12.5 7 17l99.7 99.7c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l28.3-28.3c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.6.1-34zM208 336c-70.7 0-128-57.2-128-128 0-70.7 57.2-128 128-128 70.7 0 128 57.2 128 128 0 70.7-57.2 128-128 128z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Think first<\/h3>\t\t<p>I clarify what the website needs to achieve before deciding how it should be structured and built.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M128 352H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v96c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h96c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-96c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32zm-24-80h192v48h48v-48h192v48h48v-57.59c0-21.17-17.23-38.41-38.41-38.41H344v-64h40c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32H256c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v96c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h40v64H94.41C73.23 224 56 241.23 56 262.41V320h48v-48zm264 80h-96c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v96c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h96c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-96c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32zm240 0h-96c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v96c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h96c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-96c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Structure clearly<\/h3>\t\t<p>I organize pages, content and user journeys so visitors can find what they need without friction.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M278.9 511.5l-61-17.7c-6.4-1.8-10-8.5-8.2-14.9L346.2 8.7c1.8-6.4 8.5-10 14.9-8.2l61 17.7c6.4 1.8 10 8.5 8.2 14.9L293.8 503.3c-1.9 6.4-8.5 10.1-14.9 8.2zm-114-112.2l43.5-46.4c4.6-4.9 4.3-12.7-.8-17.2L117 256l90.6-79.7c5.1-4.5 5.5-12.3.8-17.2l-43.5-46.4c-4.5-4.8-12.1-5.1-17-.5L3.8 247.2c-5.1 4.7-5.1 12.8 0 17.5l144.1 135.1c4.9 4.6 12.5 4.4 17-.5zm327.2.6l144.1-135.1c5.1-4.7 5.1-12.8 0-17.5L492.1 112.1c-4.8-4.5-12.4-4.3-17 .5L431.6 159c-4.6 4.9-4.3 12.7.8 17.2L523 256l-90.6 79.7c-5.1 4.5-5.5 12.3-.8 17.2l43.5 46.4c4.5 4.9 12.1 5.1 17 .6z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Build carefully<\/h3>\t\t<p>I create clean WordPress setups with reusable code, Git-based version control and maintainable editing flows.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M496 384H64V80c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16H16C7.16 64 0 71.16 0 80v336c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h464c8.84 0 16-7.16 16-16v-32c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16zM464 96H345.94c-21.38 0-32.09 25.85-16.97 40.97l32.4 32.4L288 242.75l-73.37-73.37c-12.5-12.5-32.76-12.5-45.25 0l-68.69 68.69c-6.25 6.25-6.25 16.38 0 22.63l22.62 22.62c6.25 6.25 16.38 6.25 22.63 0L192 237.25l73.37 73.37c12.5 12.5 32.76 12.5 45.25 0l96-96 32.4 32.4c15.12 15.12 40.97 4.41 40.97-16.97V112c.01-8.84-7.15-16-15.99-16z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Improve continuously<\/h3>\t\t<p>I test releases with Playwright, Core Web Vitals and accessibility\/WCAG checks, then refine details until the site is stable and ready to grow.<\/p>","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-09-06 21:24:59","date_gmt":"2026-09-06 21:24:59","modified":"2026-09-06 21:24:59","modified_gmt":"2026-09-06 21:24:59","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/?elementor_library=home-remote-job-version"},{"id":1216,"type":"elementor_library","status":"publish","title":"Portfolio single","slug":"portfolio-single","content":"<h2>Client<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Category<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Role<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Link<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>View project<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Problem<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Solution<\/h2>","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-04-12 19:42:21","date_gmt":"2026-04-12 19:42:21","modified":"2026-08-31 21:11:34","modified_gmt":"2026-08-31 21:11:34","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/?elementor_library=portfolio-single"},{"id":4183,"type":"elementor_library","status":"publish","title":"Footer","slug":"footer-2","content":"Contact\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Let\u2019s Talk<\/h2>\t\tNeed a senior WordPress developer for a new build, takeover or long-term support? Send a short brief or contact me directly.\t\t\t<h3>Rotterdam, The Netherlands<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"tel:+31681505645\" aria-label=\"Call Andrew Baeten\">+31 6 81 50 56 45<\/a><\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"mailto:info@andrewbaeten.nl\" aria-label=\"Email Andrew Baeten\">info@andrewbaeten.nl<\/a><\/h3>\t\t<p><strong>Available for freelance, contract and long-term WordPress work.<\/strong><\/p><p>I help businesses and agencies build clear, fast and maintainable WordPress websites.<\/p><a href=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/CV.docx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download CV<\/a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/andrew-baeten-305a1478\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LinkedIn<\/a> \u00b7 <a href=\"mailto:info@andrewbaeten.nl\">Email directly<\/a>\t\t\t<h2>Send a short brief<\/h2>\t\t<p>\u00a9 2026 Andrew Baeten. Senior WordPress Developer based in Rotterdam.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/andrew-baeten-305a1478\/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn profile\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tLinkedin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 32H31.9C14.3 32 0 46.5 0 64.3v383.4C0 465.5 14.3 480 31.9 480H416c17.6 0 32-14.5 32-32.3V64.3c0-17.8-14.4-32.3-32-32.3zM135.4 416H69V202.2h66.5V416zm-33.2-243c-21.3 0-38.5-17.3-38.5-38.5S80.9 96 102.2 96c21.2 0 38.5 17.3 38.5 38.5 0 21.3-17.2 38.5-38.5 38.5zm282.1 243h-66.4V312c0-24.8-.5-56.7-34.5-56.7-34.6 0-39.9 27-39.9 54.9V416h-66.4V202.2h63.7v29.2h.9c8.9-16.8 30.6-34.5 62.9-34.5 67.2 0 79.7 44.3 79.7 101.9V416z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"mailto:info@andrewbaeten.nl\" aria-label=\"Email Andrew Baeten\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEnvelope\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" x